  ("Negotiate, clarify, recommend award; owner approval.", "F", [], ""),
  ("Contract signing: contract sum, program, key staff, insurance, performance bond, advance payment guarantee; start-work order.", "F", ["dc_new"], "Log the signed documents in the register."),
  ("Set up contract administration: register of letters/RFI/submittals, payment certificate routine, variation procedure, meeting schedule.", "Y", ["dc_reg","dc_ipc","mom_open","is_open","ct_cal","ct_pulse"], "Interim payment certificate (cumulative, retention, advance recovery), MOM, issue tracker, calendar."),
